{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SpectralGraphTheory\/documentation\/SpectralGraphTheory\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/resistanceDistance(from:to:weight:tolerance:maxIterations:)-4cudc"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resistanceDistance","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"source","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"to","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"target","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tolerance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","k